    "created_at": "2017-03-21T02:15:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-21T02:15:30Z",
    "body": "FYI, updating WebKit to treat usemap case-sensitively broke an internal Apple site. Sadly, this site used to work in Safari 10, Firefox 52 and Chrome 57. The site is now broken is Safari TP, Firefox nightly 55 and Chrome Canary 59. This is the only evidence of breakage we have so far and this is an internal site so this is not too bad. I just thought I would mention it here in case others see breakage too.",
